#: ../../source/docs/initial-setup.rst:10 1c53e511a1df4f20850c73ef9bf30e5e
msgid ""
"First-time setup of the autopilot includes downloading and installing a "
"Ground Control Station (GCS), mounting the autopilot to the frame, "
"connecting it to the receiver, power and motors, and then performing initial"
" configuration and calibration."
msgstr "飞控的首次配置包括：下载并安装地面站（GCS）软件、将飞控安装到机架上、连接接收机/电源/电机，然后完成初始配置与校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-setup.rst:17 85cf3b39c398454b96303a3230217cab
msgid ""
"This section assumes that you've already :ref:`chosen and built a frame "
"<choosing-a-frame>` and have :ref:`selected your autopilot <common-"
"autopilots>`."
msgstr ""
"本章节假定你已经 :ref:`选好并搭建好机架 <choosing-a-frame>`，并 :ref:`选定了你的飞控 <common-"
"autopilots>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-setup.rst:20 e115c0cbafe94c26bda308ed2542846b
msgid ""
"For more information on each of these tasks (sorted by autopilot within the "
"sections) see the topics below:"
msgstr "有关每项任务的更多信息（按各节内的飞控分类），请参见以下主题："

#: ../../source/docs/initial-setup.rst:36 76551d10012b4688b7751b2105ea7ba7
msgid ""
"The next section (:ref:`First Flight <flying-arducopter>`) explains how to "
"start flying using Copter, and further tuning and configuration required for"
" new systems."
msgstr "下一节（:ref:`首飞 <flying-arducopter>`）将介绍如何使用 Copter 起飞，以及新系统所需的进一步调参与配置。"
